{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_161_title", "source_sha256": "a2184de62d14099b8f12226699660013dc6c4f828879074dab0cc04e425af9ed", "ja": "つま先の冒険", "zh": "脚尖的冒险", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_161_synopsis", "source_sha256": "b856c5d56d060db0a85d62caf7f247ede54a5f583aa504754c442e98f5f09951", "ja": "新曲をCMコンペに出す事になった志保は、\n皆と出かけた先でカフェを気にしていた。\n後日尋ねると「一人でお茶をした事がない」\nと言う志保。慌てて響と歌織に集合を掛ける\nまつりと歩。皆が集まり、お茶が始まった。", "zh": "新曲决定参与广告比稿的志保，\n在外出时留意起了沿途的咖啡馆。\n日后一问，志保坦言自己“从没一个人去喝过茶”。\n茉莉和步见状急忙叫来响与歌织。\n大家齐聚一堂，下午茶时光就此开始。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_161_1000_null", "source_sha256": "0a650bc9dab28c356d561cff9098db17e0786ec02d697ceef144f6d8c01bf0ce", "ja": "定期公演終了から数日後……", "zh": "定期公演结束数日后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_161_1001_p", "source_sha256": "fdd62896ba7b27c538808cea626879cdff8d17e41ea0fe5a8bc92f20842ebff7", "ja": "（志保の新曲は、無事コンペを通過。\nCMに採用される事になった）", "zh": "（志保的新歌顺利通过了选拔赛。\n决定将它用于广告。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_161_1003_p", "source_sha256": "c285131b4d1b052ba6f41174ccde4b8843f09890aaab91583400746f1dd18265", "ja": "あ、志保。\nあれ。", "zh": "啊，志保。\n那个。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_161_1004_033sih", "source_sha256": "e8b3017e871439fab87cf79554a78dd3fcaee484d4aa818d66d87976c72e86a8", "ja": "え？　……あ。\n新曲の……。", "zh": "诶？……啊。\n是新歌的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_161_1005_p", "source_sha256": "bd19cd6713e63f13bc8ae219ec09d6bd80a27503795bea8185e81f9e68b1dfa5", "ja": "うん。よく撮れてるな。", "zh": "嗯。拍得挺不错的嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_161_1006_033sih", "source_sha256": "2341abe21d7d3b3b378c66c78c7198939290635d8d977042b19662a2dd05b6ab", "ja": "そうですか？", "zh": "是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_161_1007_p", "source_sha256": "90c5df4670a77fb7527627a93090419bb7dc37015eb3299269b02f820fb925bf", "ja": "ああ。\nすごく大人っぽく見えるよ。", "zh": "啊。\n看起来成熟多了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_161_1008_033sih", "source_sha256": "4b1234d56ee65624133612a34665261b6b99dd173232075c4c604b40afb6f32d", "ja": "……本当の私は、こんなですけどね。", "zh": "……不过，真正的我其实是这副模样呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_161_1009_033sih", "source_sha256": "f9886f464f5fb1652be9bce719c544b2a5bfae585e29fb6bbe2663628e261d29", "ja": "あっ……もうこんな時間。\n行きましょう、{$P$}さん。", "zh": "啊……已经这么晚了。\n我们走吧，{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_161_1010_p", "source_sha256": "22807a340966f04da20a8e8e9d748bcd8e543053ec03e3c94dd9687304827f96", "ja": "そうだな。", "zh": "也是啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
